  "description": "RURTOO crystallizes in the tetragonal crystal system with space group P 4/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C150 H115 Ho5 O25,4(C7 H8). From the CIF bond table, Ho1 (Ho) has 8 O neighbors; Ho2 (Ho) has 8 O neighbors; Ho1C (Ho) has 8 O neighbors; Ho1B (Ho) has 8 O neighbors; Ho1A (Ho) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 10 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.544-5.012 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 87.60-156.38°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C150H115Ho5O25·4C7H8. Article name explicitly identifies I(II).",
